	(text "Decoupling, one per pin, next to it on the PCB:\nC13 C14 C33-C36 IOVDD x6, C37 USB_VDD, C38 ADC_AVDD,\nC19 VREG_VIN, C39 flash, C17 C40 DVDD x2, C41 VREG_VOUT.\nBOOT1 held at reset: USB drive (UF2). SWD: TP4, TP7, TP12.\nD5: USB-C feeds +5V (logic and HMI, not the motor) without\n24 V. With 24 V the TPS5430 (4.92 V) takes over."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "77b585d4-15c6-452e-b407-6aebf68ed075")
	)
	(text "Q1 / Q2 / Q3 (BSS138, Vgs(th) <= 1.5 V): level shifters, NXP AN10441. 3.3 V side: SCL, SDA, TOF_INT (GP6),\npulled up by R1 / R5 / R10 to +3V3. Sensor side (2.8 V): SCL, SDA and GPIO1 of U3, R2 / R6 / R11 to +2V8.\nA low from the RP2040 or the INA226 reaches the sensor at about 0.2 V, under its 0.6 V VIL."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 271.78 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5389682e-49f1-498b-a6c2-11d38c96c3ab")
	)
